    "updated_at": "2021-08-26T14:23:26Z",
    "body": "You are correct.  This issue was written before we settled on the final shape for URLPattern.  We don't need to expose a separate URLPathnamePattern object since you can use `URLPattern({ pathname: '/foo' })` as you say.\r\n\r\nI tagged this issue as \"service-worker\" because the main decision here is about how we will integrate URLPattern with service worker scopes.  For historical reasons thats mixed up in this URLPattern repo now.  Eventually this will get moved into the service worker spec.",
