    "body": "[ServiceWorker Static Routing API](https://github.com/WICG/service-worker-static-routing-api) provides a way to bypass service worker in some specific URLs in the registered scope.\r\n\r\nIf the scope pattern matching for the service worker registration is required for the bypassing purpose, it can achievable by the the static routing API. [The example](https://github.com/WICG/service-worker-static-routing-api/tree/main#bypassing-serviceworker-for-particular-resources) in the explainer describes how to bypass SW on pages in the scope.\r\n\r\nI'll close this issue but feel free to reopen if needed.",
